...@../../_tools/theme
direction: down

coordinator: 코디네이터 (HomeRenovationPlanner) { class: ours }
rendering_editor: 렌더링 수정 에이전트 (RenderingEditor) { class: ours }
edit_tool: 렌더링 편집 도구 (edit_renovation_rendering) { class: ours }
util_tools: 보조 도구 (list_renovation_renderings) { class: ours }

flash: gemini-3-flash-preview { class: ext }
google_search: google_search { class: ext }

coordinator -> flash: instruction + transfer_to_agent 선언
rendering_editor -> flash: instruction + 편집 도구 선언
rendering_editor -> edit_tool: edit_renovation_rendering 호출
rendering_editor -> util_tools: list_renovation_renderings 호출
flash -> google_search: 내장 그라운딩 (search_agent 단계)
